The '''Survivor Cube''' is a {{Rare}} [[Accessory]], which gives the player {{stat|vitality|3}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Survivor Cube''' cannot be crafted, and instead it can be claimed upon reaching {{CollectionLink|Spider Slayer 7}} from {{NPCSprite|Maddox the Slayer}}.  

Once obtained, it can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} for {{Coins|20,000,000}}.  

